OL,3,GNEWSAWhat it is like on a 10-hour shift
OL,4,Aas a paramedic during the summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe challenges the NHS faces in winter
OL,7,Fare well known, but sustained hot
OL,8,Fweather has seen health services face
OL,9,Fincreasing pressure over the summer
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FSouth Western Ambulance Service Trust
OL,13,F(Swast) typically responds to about
OL,14,F3,200 incidents a day at this time of
OL,15,Fyear, but on one day in June - its
OL,16,Fbusiest day ever - it responded to
OL,17,F4,350 incidents.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
