OL,3,GNEWSAWhat it is like on a 10-hour shift
OL,4,Aas a paramedic during the summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt received more than 5,200 calls to
OL,7,Fits 999 control room that day, when
OL,8,Ftemperatures reached a
OL,9,Fthen-record-breaking June high of
OL,10,F36.7C.
OL,12,FCommon conditions associated with
OL,13,Fprolonged periods of hot weather
OL,14,Finclude falls, breathing difficulties,
OL,15,Funconsciousness and fainting.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
